            <div xml:id="d34">

                <pb facs="0142" n="26" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg26"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 863.0011/17.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Emperor.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Great and Good Friend</hi>: I have received Your
                    Majesty’s letter of the 2d of August last, in which you conveyed to me the sad
                    tidings of the deaths on the 28th of June, of Your Majesty’s dearly beloved
                    nephew His Imperial and Royal Highness the Arch Duke Franz Ferdinand and Her
                    Highness the Duchess of Hohenberg.</p>
                <p>I learn with deep sorrow of the great affliction which has befallen Your Majesty
                    and I offer to you my sincere and heartfelt condolences.</p>
                <p>May God have Your Majesty and Your Majesty’s Family in His safe and holy
                    keeping.</p>
                <p>Your Good Friend,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi></signed>. <lb/> By the
                    President: <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of State</hi>. <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-20"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">October 20, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
